    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, are you going\n",
        "to take the Gym challenge?\r",
        "Gee, you keep getting tougher and\n",
        "tougher, don’t you?\r",
        "Me? Well, I went shopping at the\n",
        "department store, and...\r",
        "I mean, well, of course I’ve been\n",
        "working on my Pokédex, but...\r",
        "I’ll catch you later!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: Hey! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, are you\n",
        "going to take on the Gym Leader?\r",
        "Wow, you just keep getting tougher\n",
        "and tougher.\r",
        "Me? Well, I took a look in the\n",
        "Game Corner, and...\r",
        "I mean, yeah, of course I’ve been\n",
        "working on my Pokédex, but...\r",
        "Anyways, keep it up!\n",
        "I’ll see you around!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: Hey, you!\n",
        "Yeah, you!\r",
        "This is Team Galactic’s warehouse!\n",
        "It ain’t no playground for kids!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: Hey, you!\n",
        "Yeah, you!\r",
        "This is Team Galactic’s warehouse!\n",
        "It ain’t no playground for kids!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: This is the awesome Team\n",
        "Galactic’s awesome warehouse!\r",
        "A little kid like you should be playing\n",
        "at the Pokémon Gym.\r",
        "After all, the Gym Leader happens to\n",
        "be a kid just like you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: What? Now you’ve brought\n",
        "your buddy along so you can get your\\fPokédex back?\r",
        "We’ll be just as happy to send both\n",
        "of you crying home to your mommies!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: You’re trying to get the\n",
        "Pokédex back from us?\r",
        "Not when we, Team Galactic, can make\n",
        "so much better use of it!\r",
        "But, OK, guarding the warehouse\n",
        "does get boring!\r",
        "We’ll take you on two-on-two!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 1: Aww, that stinks!\n",
        "Our Pokémon are chumps!\r",
        "We should get new ones from\n",
        "headquarters.\r",
        "Humph! Who cares about some\n",
        "Pokédex anyways?\r",
        "Team Galactic’s going to own\n",
        "all the Pokémon in the world...\\fNo, in the universe!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "There! Take it!\n",
        "Take your Pokédex!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Grunt 2: Those things we had in\n",
        "the warehouse’ve already been moved\\fto Pastoria City anyway...\r",
        "So, we’ll say “You’ll get yours!”\n",
        "And run like the grunts we are.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Please, can you help me?\r",
