    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: You and your Pokémon together\n",
        "with me and my Pokémon...\r",
        "United like this, our dream team\n",
        "has no chance of losing!\r",
        "I’m not letting those bad people get\n",
        "away with their dirty deeds!\r"
