      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: I’ll be waiting.\n",
        "Please get ready and come quickly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: What’s going on?\r",
        "Why is Team Galactic out in the\n",
        "streets like they own the place?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, thank you,\n",
        "sincerely.\r",
        "If Professor Rowan ever finds out that\n",
        "I lost my Pokédex...\r",
        "Eewww...\n",
        "I don’t want to think about it.\r",
        "So, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, what are you going\n",
        "to do now?\r",
        "I’m thinking of going to Pastoria\n",
        "City now.\r",
        "The Great Marsh there is home to\n",
        "many kinds of Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
