      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, thanks,\n",
        "honestly.\r",
        "If Professor Rowan ever hears that\n",
        "I lost my Pokédex...\r",
        "Oh, man, that’s something I do not\n",
