    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "There!\n",
        "Would you look at those antennae?\r",
        "I don’t know what they do, but those\n",
        "are some mighty impressive antennae!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey!\n",
        "It’s you!\r",
        "I bet you don’t remember me, but\n",
        "I sure remember you!\r",
        "Because of you, they took my CLEFAIRY\n",
        "away...\r",
        "My partner called it quits and went\n",
        "back to his old country...\r",
        "I don’t know anything about any\n",
        "Storage Key!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "We have the Hidden Machine that teaches\n",
        "Fly stored in the warehouse.\r",
        "They said I can use it if I show them\n",
        "that I deserve it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1056_C07_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "Yeah, Team Galactic is hiding all sorts\n",
        "of good stuff in their warehouse.\r",
        "I hear they even have a Hidden\n",
        "Machine in there!"
      ]
    },
